008500     05  REQ-RETBS                        PIC XX.
008600     05  REQ-WO-AMT-APP                   PIC 9(11)V99.
008700     05  REQ-WO-AMT-COMM                  PIC 9(11)V99.
008800     05  REQ-AMT-NOT-PUR                  PIC 9(11)V99.
008900     05  REQ-AMT-AVAIL                    PIC 9(11)V99.
